子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2682.23, "timestamp": "00:44:42", "text": "那里有很多食物。如果你发现"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2683.43, "timestamp": "00:44:43", "text": "大的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2686.309, "timestamp": "00:44:46", "text": "房间里有很多死去的史莱姆，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2688.95, "timestamp": "00:44:48", "text": "可能是因为我们当中有人……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2696.069, "timestamp": "00:44:56", "text": "就像那个酸橙果冻一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2698.87, "timestamp": "00:44:58", "text": "蜱虫发现蜱虫开始进食。"}]